lass="link_row" data-label="log_out" href="https://itch.io/logout?token=WyJnTGhnIiwxNzkwNTIzNjQ3LCIyOWlVMWFidHRJR2NjdGkiXQ%3D%3D.chXL9LwZLgAdtFjYY9vFL79aDmM%3D">Log out</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="header_dropdown" data-target="browse"><a href="https://itch.io/games">Games</a><a href="https://itch.io/tools">Game development</a><a href="https://itch.io/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="https://itch.io/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="https://itch.io/sales">Sales</a><a href="https://itch.io/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="https://itch.io/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="https://itch.io/tags">Tags</a><a href="https://itch.io/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><ul id="user_tools" class="user_tools"><li><a class="follow_user_btn follow_button_widget is_following action_btn" data-unfollow_url="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/-/unfollow?source=profile" data-follow_url="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/-/follow?source=profile" data-user_id="18231948" href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/"><span class="on_follow"><span class="icon icon-plus"></span>Follow The SideQuest Shop</span><span class="on_unfollow"><span class="icon icon-checkmark"></span>Following The SideQuest Shop</span><span class="unfollow_label">Unfollow The SideQuest Shop</span></a></li></ul><div id="wrapper" class="user_page_wrap" style="min-height: 915px;"><div id="user_3536252" class="user_page page_widget base_widget mode_column" tabindex="-1"><div id="profile_header" class="header"><div class="image_header"><img class="profile_banner"></div><div class="inner_column text_header"><h1>The SideQuest Shop</h1></div></div><div class="inner_column profile_content"><div class="columns"><div class="column profile_column"><div id="user_links_9774368" class="user_links user_links_widget base_widget"></div><div class="user_profile formatted"><p>Sixteen themed low-poly prop packs, one visual system. Every environment: a lab, a supermarket, a card shop, a casino floor, a gym, a laundromat, an arcade, a bowling alley, a roller rink, a cinema lobby, a municipal pool, a fast-food kitchen, a bank vault, a car wash, a recording studio, an observatory, is built to the same spec: flat-shaded stylized geometry, one 1024x1024 gradient atlas per pack so props batch into a single draw call, GLB + FBX exports, real-world metre scale, and base-centred pivots so drop-in placement just works. Every prop is deterministic procedural geometry: a Python program emits it, so each build is byte-identical rather than resampled. Each comes with an auto-generated README listing per-prop tri counts, because guessing your budget from a thumbnail is a bad way to build a scene.</p>
<p>The model's simple: the base prop set is free and CC0 1.0, public domain, commercial use, no attribution, ever. If you want more range without more geometry, the $7.95 colourways tier rebuilds every prop across four full art-directed palettes (not recolours, considered schemes), licensed royalty-free for your projects.</p>
<p><strong>The retro entertainment district</strong>: six packs that share a street, each carrying an After Dark colourway so they build one coherent liminal night scene</p>
<ul><li><strong>Token Gesture</strong>: a retro arcade, cabinets lit and the claw machine still rigged.</li><li><strong>League Night</strong>: a bowling alley, modular lanes and a regulation pin deck.</li><li><strong>All Skate</strong>: a roller rink under a mirror ball, rental skates included.</li><li><strong>Second Feature</strong>: a cinema lobby, popcorn machine to marquee.</li><li><strong>House Edge</strong>: a casino floor, felt and neon, odds not included.</li><li><strong>Heavy Cycle</strong>: a laundromat, machines humming, quarters not included.</li></ul>
<p><strong>Service and sim</strong>: the working spaces behind the counter</p>
<ul><li><strong>Aisle Nine</strong>: a supermarket floor, aisle by aisle, shelf-stocked and ready to walk.</li><li><strong>Mint Condition</strong>: a TCG card shop, binders and boosters included.</li><li><strong>Rush Order</strong>: a fast-food kitchen line, fryer bank to drive-thru window.</li><li><strong>Hard Cash</strong>: a bank and vault, handwheel door and safe-deposit wall.</li><li><strong>Spot Free</strong>: a car wash tunnel, brushes to blowers.</li><li><strong>One More Rep</strong>: a gym, racked and ready for the next set.</li><li><strong>No Diving</strong>: a municipal pool, coping to lifeguard chair.</li><li><strong>Sci-Fi Lab &amp; Medical Props</strong>: stocked for the scene right before something goes wrong.</li></ul>
<p><strong>Showpieces</strong>: fewer props, far more object in each one</p>
<ul><li><strong>First Light</strong>: an observatory, a geared brass orrery and an equatorial refractor. Six colourways, and the only pack that also ships every prop as its own file. $11.95.</li><li><strong>Studio Time</strong>: a recording studio in five pieces, console to half-stack. A mini-pack at $4.95.</li></ul>
<p>277 props. 80 art-directed palettes. One spec.</p>
<p>Pick a pack, drop it in, batch it in one call.</p></div></div><div class="column game_column"><div class="game_grid_widget base_widget user_game_grid"><div class="game_cell has_cover" dir="auto" data-game_id="4921232"><div class="game_thumb"><a class="thumb_link game_link" data-action="game_grid" tabindex="-1" data-label="game:4921232:thumb" href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/dungeon-spoils-fantasy-loot-props"><img data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NDIwMjM0LmpwZw==/315x250%23c/ZrJe8h.jpg" height="250" width="315" class="lazy_loaded" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NDIwMjM0LmpwZw==/315x250%23c/ZrJe8h.jpg"></a></div><div class="game_cell_data"><div class="game_title"><a class="title game_link" data-action="game_grid" href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/dungeon-spoils-fantasy-loot-props" data-label="game:4921232:title">Dungeon Spoils: Fantasy Loot Props</a><div title="Pay $4.95 or more for this game" class="price_tag meta_tag"><div class="price_value">$4.95</div></div></div><div class="game_author"><a data-label="user:18231948" data-action="game_grid" href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/">The SideQuest Shop</a></div></div></div><div class="game_cell has_cover" dir="auto" data-game_id="4904558"><div class="game_thumb"><a class="thumb_link game_link" data-action="game_grid" tabindex="-1" data-label="game:4904558:thumb" href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/extra-pearls-boba-tea-cup-props"><img data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MzIwMjk3LmpwZw==/315x250%23c/wnu81w.jpg" height="250" width="315" class="lazy_loaded" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MzIwMjk3LmpwZw==/315x250%23c/wnu81w.jpg"></a></div><div class="game_cell_data"><div class="game_title"><a class="title game_link" data-action="game_grid" href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/extra-pearls-boba-tea-cup-props" data-label="game:4904558:title">Extra Pearls: Boba Tea Cup Props</a><div title="Pay $4.95 or more for this asset pack" class="price_tag meta_tag"><div class="price_valu